acceptance_criteria: "The blocks population is partitioned by provenance so an evidence-cited ordering edge and a fabricated directional edge are separately countable; The anti-fabrication property remains enforced as a ceiling over the unsourced partition, with a negative control proving it still fails; The evidence-cited partition is enforced as a floor so a later pass cannot silently delete recovered ordering; pm-1w6scp, pm-gxs55a and pm-ye46ns each carry a typed edge to this item so the dependency is readable from either side"
goal: Provable history
objective: Make delivery sequence reconstructible by graph traversal
value: Unblocks the ordering half of the historical-spine reconstruction without giving up the anti-fabrication guarantee
impact: Three accepted items currently cannot land as specified
outcome: Ordering edges carry provenance and are enforced by a partitioned declaration
